#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_bbcodes.rst:250
msgid "Registering Custom Variables"
msgstr "Registrering af brugerdefinerede variabler"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_bbcodes.rst:252
msgid ""
"It is possible to register custom variables to be used during parsing. For "
"instance, phpBB uses ``max_font_size`` to limit the values used in the "
"``[font]`` tag dynamically. Callbacks used during parsing must be static and"
" serializable as the parser itself is cached in a serialized form. However, "
"custom variables are set at parsing time and are not limited to scalar "
"types. For instance, they can be used to access the current user object "
"during parsing."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at registrere brugerdefinerede variabler, der skal bruges "
"under parsing. phpBB bruger f.eks. ``max_font_size`` til dynamisk at "
"begrænse de værdier, der bruges i tagget ``[font]``. Callbacks, der bruges "
"under parsing, skal være statiske og serialiserbare, da selve parseren "
"caches i serialiseret form. Brugerdefinerede variabler sættes dog på "
"parsingtidspunktet og er ikke begrænset til skalar-typer. De kan f.eks. "
"bruges til at tilgå det aktuelle brugerobjekt under parsing."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_bbcodes.rst:258
msgid ""
"In the following example, we add an attribute filter to modify URLs used in "
"``[url]`` BBCodes and links. In addition to the attribute's value (the URL) "
"we request that the custom variable ``my.id`` be passed as the second "
"parameter. It's a good idea to namespace the variable names to avoid "
"collisions with other extensions or phpBB itself."
msgstr ""
"I følgende eksempel tilføjer vi et attributfilter til at ændre URL'er, der "
"bruges i BBCode'en ``[url]`` og links. Ud over attributtens værdi (URL'en) "
"anmoder vi om, at den brugerdefinerede variabel ``my.id`` sendes som den "
"anden parameter. Det er en god idé at give variabelnavnene namespace for at "
"undgå kollisioner med andre udvidelser eller phpBB selv."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_bbcodes.rst:263
msgid ""
"The ``core.text_formatter_s9e_parser_setup`` event uses "
"``$event['parser']->set_var()`` to set a value for ``my.id`` variable once "
"per initialization. The ``core.text_formatter_s9e_parse_before`` event could"
" be used to set the value before each parsing."
msgstr ""
"Eventet ``core.text_formatter_s9e_parser_setup`` bruger "
"``$event['parser']->set_var()`` til at sætte en værdi for variablen "
"``my.id`` én gang pr. initialisering. Eventet "
"``core.text_formatter_s9e_parse_before`` kunne bruges til at sætte værdien "
"før hver parsing."

