"<https://s9etextformatter.readthedocs.io/Filters/Callback_signature/>`_"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_bbcodes.rst:309
msgid "Enable Text Formatter Plugins"
msgstr "Aktivering af Text Formatter-plugins"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_bbcodes.rst:311
msgid ""
"The Text Formatter library has a collection of plugins that can be enabled "
"through an extension, such as MediaEmbed, Pipe Tables, etc."
msgstr ""
"Text Formatter-biblioteket har en samling af plugins, der kan aktiveres "
"gennem en udvidelse, såsom MediaEmbed, Pipe Tables osv."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_bbcodes.rst:314
msgid ""
"Plugins can be toggled via the ``configurator`` var available through the "
"``core.text_formatter_s9e_configure_before`` and "
"``core.text_formatter_s9e_configure_after`` events which respectively "
"trigger before and after the default settings are configured."
msgstr ""
"Plugins kan slås til/fra via ``configurator``-variablen, der er tilgængelig "
"gennem eventene ``core.text_formatter_s9e_configure_before`` og "
"``core.text_formatter_s9e_configure_after``, som henholdsvis udløses før og "
"efter standardindstillingerne konfigureres."

